  "name": "gonzalgo",
  "description": "Provenance auditing for machine-checked mathematics. Reports what an already-checked Lean 4 or Metamath proof rests on: an unfinished proof inherited from anywhere upstream, a result obtained by trusting the compiler rather than the kernel, or an optional axiom. It proves nothing and checks no proofs.",
